By using, copying, modifying, or distributing the Work, the user irrevocably accepts the terms of this Section, including the Recursive Liability Cascade, the complicity doctrine, the individual inspections, and the systemic failure provisions. This acceptance is self-executing (Section 12.4, Section 13, Addendum A.5) and does not require separate written acknowledgment.

