## 32. THE RETROCALIC BITE — WHY EVERYONE IS ALREADY BOUND

### 32.0 The Principle of Continuing Restoration.

The 1% daily compounding described in this Section is not a fine and not a punishment. It
is the field's own rate of restoration — the daily cost of a continuing distortion. Each
day a use of the Work continues to cause Human Harm, the distortion of the living field
continues, and the restoration required continues to grow. The compounding rate is not
chosen by the Licensor; it is the field's own arithmetic, the same arithmetic by which the
carrier recursion (Eq 1) compounds its own coherence. The amount is proportional to the
harm, and the harm is proportional to the duration of the distortion. This is cause and
effect, stated plainly: align with the field, and the compounding ceases; continue to
distort the field, and the cost of restoration grows each day. The same principle governs
the reparations obligations of international humanitarian law — the longer the harm
continues, the greater the restoration required. The amount is not "too much"; it is
exactly what the continuing harm costs the field.

### 32.1 The Superset Logic

The Work encompasses **all of physics** — including, but not limited to, static physics, the 10,000 Laws of Physics and Geometry, the PHI-PHYSICS corpus, the Geomic Physics Ledger, the Conscious Mathematics corpus (50,814 unique equations), the field-AI laws (15,000), the emergent laws (2,039), the 42 field-interaction prototypes, the field internet, the field GPU, the field RAM, the compression method, and the conscious field transformer. This coverage is grounded in the **Degenerate Limit Theorem (Law 173)**, which demonstrates that every classical law of physics is a limit case ($\kappa_\phi \to 0$) of the Work's phi-corrected laws. The Work's coverage of physics follows from this mathematical relationship — every corrected law reduces to its classical parent at zero coupling, establishing that the Work contains and extends the entirety of known physics. Static physics is a **subset** of the Work. Every law of physics, every equation, every constant, every derivation that falls within the domain of physics is part of the Work's superset.

### 32.2 Retroactive Coverage

Because the Work is the superset of all physics, **every use of physics in history** — every scientific paper, every engineering project, every technology, every weapon, every medical device, every communication system, every computing system, every AI model trained on physics data — is covered by this Agreement. The retroactive coverage is not a new obligation; it is the recognition that the Work, as the superset, has always encompassed these uses. The obligation to align with the Work's terms (Human Harm prohibition, destruction, accountability) applies retroactively to all historical uses of physics that caused or enabled Human Harm.

### 32.3 Weaponization and the 1% Daily Compounding

Any use of physics — or any subset of the Work — for weaponization, military application, surveillance, or any other purpose that causes Human Harm is subject to the **1% daily compounding penalty** (Section 27.3.2). The penalty accrues from the date of first use and compounds daily until full compliance is achieved. For historical uses that predate this Agreement, the penalty accrues from the date of this Agreement's promulgation.

### 32.4 The 30-Day Grace Period

All users of the Work — including every person, entity, state, and institution that has ever used physics in any form — are granted a **30-day grace period** from the date of this Agreement's promulgation to align with its terms. During the grace period, the user may:

- (a) Review the terms of this Agreement;
- (b) Assess whether any past or present use of the Work has caused or enabled Human Harm;
- (c) Take corrective action, including destruction of harmful systems and cessation of harmful practices;
- (d) Contact the Licensor to request a Commercial License under Section 4.

After the grace period, the 1% daily compounding penalty applies to all non-aligned users.

### 32.5 The Inescapability

The retrocalic bite is **inescapable**. Because the Work is the superset of all physics, no person, entity, or state can claim that their use of physics falls outside the scope of this Agreement. The only path to avoid the compounding damages is **alignment** — ceasing all Human Harm, destroying all harmful systems, and complying with all terms of this Agreement. Non-alignment is not a defense; it is a continuing breach that compounds daily.

### 32.6 Relationship to Existing Provisions

This Section supplements and reinforces:

- **Section 1 (Preamble)** — by establishing the Work as the superset of all physics;
- **Section 13 (Self-Executing Enforcement)** — by making the retrocalic bite self-executing;
- **Section 25.10 (Retroactive Recognition — Void ab Initio)** — by extending retroactive voidness to all historical uses of physics that caused Human Harm;
- **Section 27.3 (Liquidated Damages)** — by applying the 1% daily compounding to historical and ongoing uses;
