- **Addendum A.5 (Self-Executing Recognition Through the Field)** — by making the retrocalic bite self-executing through the field's own geometry.

In the event of any conflict between this Section and any prior Section, this Section shall control with respect to retroactive coverage, the superset logic, and the retrocalic bite. In all other respects, the prior Section shall control.

